{"hymn":"S270","parent":"E333","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"No sé por qué el sumo Dios","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Hecha firme por las provisiones divinas","syl":{"n1":"No","n2":"sé","n3":"por","n4":"qué","n7":"el","n8":["su","i"],"n9":["mo","t"],"n10":"Dios","n11":"Su","n12":["gra","i"],"n13":["cia","t"],"n14":["re","i"],"n16":["ve","m"],"n18":["ló,","t"],"n19":"Ni","n20":"por","n21":["qué,‿in","i"],"n22":["dig","m"],"n24":["no","t"],"n26":["co","i"],"n27":["mo","t"],"n28":"soy,","n29":["Je","i"],"n30":["sús","t"],"n31":"me","n32":["re","i"],"n34":["di","m"],"n36":["mió.","t"],"n37":"Mas","n38":"yo","n39":"sé","n40":"a","n41":"quién","n42":"he","n43":["cre","i"],"n44":["í","m"],"n45":["do","t"],"n46":["Y‿es","i"],"n47":["toy","t"],"n48":["se","i"],"n49":["gu","m"],"n50":["ro","t"],"n51":"que‿es","n52":["po","i"],"n53":["de","m"],"n54":["ro","m"],"n55":["so,","t"],"n56":["Guar","i"],"n57":["dan","m"],"n58":["do","t"],"n59":["lo‿en","i"],"n60":["co","m"],"n61":["men","m"],"n62":["da","m"],"n63":["do","t"],"n64":["Has","i"],"n65":["ta‿el","t"],"n66":["dí","i"],"n67":["a‿en","t"],"n68":"que","n69":["ven","i"],"n70":["drá.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["No sé cómo Su fe me dio","Para salvarme así,","Ni cómo Su Palabra fiel","Tal paz legó en mí."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["No sé cómo el Espíritu","Convence al pecador,","Y la Palabra de Jesús","Le infunde fe y amor."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["No sé si el bien o si el mal","Me esperan hoy aquí,","O si tristeza o gozo habrá","Antes de Él venir."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["No sé cuándo el Señor vendrá,","De noche ó al clarear,","Ni sé si he de fallecer","O me‿arrebatará."]}]}